cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ResearchLog: a local-first, AI-native research project and progress manager"
abstract: >-
  A project and progress manager for researchers. It supports project goals and
  milestones, papers/repositories/notes, Markdown and LaTeX reading, weekly
  reviews, and exposes the same local research memory to agents through MCP.
